{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>為慶祝邁向59周年，電視廣播城將於11月19日首辦400米賽跑競技環節。昨日六大參賽名單正式曝光，大師姐陳庭欣 …</p><p></p>\n<p>為慶祝邁向59周年，電視廣播城將於11月19日首辦400米賽跑競技環節。昨日六大參賽名單正式曝光，大師姐陳庭欣慘遭一眾師妹挑釁。這場熱血對決最終誰勝誰負充滿變數。</p>\n<h2>六位東張女神過磅抽籤火藥味濃</h2>\n<p>昨日賽前記者會由關曜儁擔任司儀，正式公開六位《東張西望》參賽跑女名單，包括陳庭欣、李旻芳、黎寬怡、梁敏巧、何沛珈及甘詠寧。眾人穿上運動戰衣亮相，並仿效專業賽事進行公開過磅及即場抽籤決定出賽號碼與賽道。當中資深外景主持李旻芳錄得116磅，對撼全場最輕盈僅105磅並被視為大熱門黎寬怡。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445628885886700_1211762416af53ae17bc96.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445628885886700_1211762416af53ae17bc96.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445629098163709_4478583226af53ae357370.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：IG@toby_yanyan）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445629098163709_4478583226af53ae357370.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@toby_yanyan）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>大師姐陳庭欣反擊揚言秘密操肌雪恥</h2>\n<p>平日主力坐鎮錄影廠主持工作被笑指缺乏街頭追訪實戰經驗，陳庭欣面對外景師妹重點狙擊毫不退縮。她透露為備戰今次400米大戰已刻意暫停打球一星期，並轉攻健身室狂練腿部肌肉。陳庭欣更即場反擊表示：「我依家每日收工都會陪外景同事一齊『追巴士』練習，到時大家千祈唔好睇小我！」</p>\n<h2>梁敏巧40分鐘狂奔追擊獸父成經典</h2>\n<p>今次賽事旨在將日常狂奔追訪涉事者畫面搬上真實賽道。回顧過去最彪炳戰績，去年梁敏巧追查案件時與拔足逃跑涉事人展開長達40分鐘街頭追逐戰。她當時由大廈一路狂追至鬧市街頭，期間緊咬不放並厲聲質問：「我看到你現在刪除照片，先生！你為什麼要這麼害怕？」最終力追至警方到場將男子拘捕。\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e6%a2%81%e6%95%8f%e5%b7%a7-%e6%9d%b1%e5%bc%b5%e8%a5%bf%e6%9c%9b-%e8%bf%bd%e9%80%90%e6%88%b0-3382785/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東張西望｜梁敏巧旺角街頭40分鐘追逐戰 自爆擁有「驚人體力」秘訣</a></p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/177319864898192419_128807043669b0dd3949a89.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 梁敏巧40分鐘狂奔追擊獸父成經典（圖片來源：截圖@TVB《東張西望》）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/177319864898192419_128807043669b0dd3949a89.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>梁敏巧40分鐘狂奔追擊獸父成經典（圖片來源：截圖@TVB《東張西望》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445629522990896_18280715306af53ae7aa496.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：截圖@TVB《東張西望》）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445629522990896_18280715306af53ae7aa496.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：截圖@TVB《東張西望》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>觀眾湧入官方平台競猜最終跑女賽果</h2>\n<p>為了增加賽事刺激感，官方網站及社交平台已同步推出競猜遊戲，讓觀眾預測哪位參賽者會拿下第一名及最後一名。大批網民隨即湧入留言區參與討論，有人留言表示：「大師姐隨時爆冷跑出」、「最輕磅實著數」，熱烈分析六位選手實力。目前投票活動將持續至下周四晚公佈賽果前。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/nj7ia-1_17720696226af53caf596f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"752\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/nj7ia-1_17720696226af53caf596f4.jpg\" width=\"787\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/513df06b-a6f9-4d15-b8c7-2f5339c85ea0_16982145006af53cb526223-1024x820.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"769\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/513df06b-a6f9-4d15-b8c7-2f5339c85ea0_16982145006af53cb526223-1024x820.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/arjaz-1_17414018006af53cab606cf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"752\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/arjaz-1_17414018006af53cab606cf.jpg\" width=\"938\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hxnhk-1_13099926af53cb3122f9-1024x696.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"653\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hxnhk-1_13099926af53cb3122f9-1024x696.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ev6dj-1_9810930446af53caa0bbea-1024x675.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"633\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ev6dj-1_9810930446af53caa0bbea-1024x675.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rxtb4-1_6599744386af53cb149a83-1024x723.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"678\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/rxtb4-1_6599744386af53cb149a83-1024x723.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/6jdmh-1_6946744606af53ca8e40a2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"752\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/6jdmh-1_6946744606af53ca8e40a2.jpg\" width=\"1018\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/qprks-1_18291279866af53cad63d9a-1024x720.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳庭欣 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"675\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/qprks-1_18291279866af53cad63d9a-1024x720.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e5%bc%b5%e8%a5%bf%e6%9c%9b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東張西望</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%90%ac%e5%8d%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bc%9d%e8%b3%80%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b62026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬千星輝賀台慶2026</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e5%ba%ad%e6%ac%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳庭欣</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB、IG@toby_yanyan、截圖@TVB《東張西望》資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3540840\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 12 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:23:50.856309+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1310,"images":12,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T04:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:27.021326+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:27.021326+00:00","content_hash":"433864d15cdba1476aff983ed9c4214612e76aa1c3b21e3138e4c35762c2f8dd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}